### Payment Confirmation Workflow - API Test Suite
### Test the new invoice and confirmation features

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@orderId = YOUR_ORDER_ID_HERE

### 1. Get Order Details
# First, get an order to test with
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. View Invoice in Browser (HTML)
# Returns HTML that can be viewed in browser
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/html

###

### 3. Download Invoice as File
# Downloads the invoice as an HTML file
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get User's Order History
# View all orders for the authenticated user
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Get Payment Details
# View payment information
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Scenario: Complete Purchase Flow
# This tests the entire payment confirmation workflow

### Step 1: Create Checkout Session
POST {{apiUrl}}/payments/create-checkout-session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serverPlanId": "YOUR_SERVER_PLAN_ID",
  "quantity": 1
}

# Response will include sessionId and checkoutUrl
# User completes payment on Stripe checkout page

###

### Step 2: Check Checkout Session Status
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/checkout-session/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Step 3: Verify Order Was Created (via webhook)
# After payment, webhook should have created the order
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

# Verify:
# - Status is "Completed"
# - PaymentDate is set
# - PaymentTransactionId is populated

###

### Step 4: View Invoice
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/html

# Verify invoice displays:
# - Order number
# - Customer details
# - Payment information
# - Itemized charges
# - Total amount
# - PAID status badge

###

### Step 5: Download Invoice
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Verify file downloads with correct filename:
# Invoice-{OrderNumber}.html

###

### Email Verification Tests
# These are for manual verification as emails are sent via webhook

### After completing a purchase, check that:
# 1. Confirmation email is received at the user's email address
# 2. Email contains:
#    - Order number
#    - Order date
#    - Itemized list of purchases
#    - Total amount
#    - Payment method
#    - Billing address
#    - Links to dashboard and order details
#    - Support contact information
# 3. Email is well-formatted and mobile-responsive
# 4. Links in email work correctly

###

### Error Handling Tests

### Test: Unauthorized Access to Invoice
# Try to access invoice without authentication
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice

# Expected: 401 Unauthorized

###

### Test: Access Another User's Invoice
# Try to access an order that doesn't belong to you
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{otherUsersOrderId}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Expected: 403 Forbidden

###

### Test: Non-existent Order
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Expected: 404 Not Found

###

### Integration Tests with Stripe Webhooks

### Simulate Stripe Webhooks (for testing purposes)
# Note: In production, these come from Stripe directly

### Webhook: Checkout Session Completed
POST {{apiUrl}}/payments/webhook
Stripe-Signature: {{stripeSignature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt_test_webhook",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "checkout.session.completed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_session",
      "payment_status": "paid",
      "payment_intent": "pi_test_intent",
      "customer_email": "customer@example.com",
      "amount_total": 2999,
      "currency": "usd",
      "metadata": {
        "user_id": "{{userId}}",
        "server_plan_id": "{{serverPlanId}}",
        "quantity": "1"
      }
    }
  }
}

# After webhook:
# 1. Verify order was created/updated
# 2. Verify order status is "Completed"
# 3. Verify confirmation email was sent
# 4. Verify payment record was created

###

### Webhook: Payment Intent Succeeded
POST {{apiUrl}}/payments/webhook
Stripe-Signature: {{stripeSignature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt_test_webhook",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_test_intent",
      "amount": 2999,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "metadata": {
        "user_id": "{{userId}}",
        "order_id": "{{orderId}}"
      }
    }
  }
}

# After webhook:
# 1. Verify order status updated to "Completed"
# 2. Verify confirmation email was sent
# 3. Verify payment record was updated

###

### Combined Invoice Test
# Test generating invoice for multiple orders
POST {{apiUrl}}/orders/combined-invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [
    "{{orderId1}}",
    "{{orderId2}}",
    "{{orderId3}}"
  ]
}

# Expected: Combined invoice HTML with all orders

###

### Performance Tests

### Test: Multiple Concurrent Invoice Requests
# Test that invoice generation handles concurrent requests
GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId2}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{apiUrl}}/orders/{{orderId3}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Validation Checklist

## Order Confirmation Page ✓
- [ ] Page displays after successful payment
- [ ] Order number is shown
- [ ] Order details are correct
- [ ] Billing information is displayed
- [ ] Payment method is shown
- [ ] Next steps are clear
- [ ] Links to dashboard work
- [ ] Support information is visible

## Confirmation Email ✓
- [ ] Email is sent automatically
- [ ] Subject line is clear
- [ ] Order number is in subject
- [ ] Email contains order details
- [ ] Payment information is correct
- [ ] Billing address is shown
- [ ] Links work (dashboard, order details)
- [ ] Email is mobile-responsive
- [ ] Plain text version exists
- [ ] Branding is consistent
- [ ] Support contact info is included

## Invoice/Receipt ✓
- [ ] Invoice displays correctly
- [ ] Invoice number is unique
- [ ] Order number is referenced
- [ ] Customer information is correct
- [ ] Billing address is shown
- [ ] Payment details are accurate
- [ ] Itemized charges are clear
- [ ] Total amount is correct
- [ ] Payment status is shown (PAID/PENDING)
- [ ] Transaction ID is displayed
- [ ] Company information is present
- [ ] Layout is print-friendly
- [ ] Invoice can be downloaded

## Order Status ✓
- [ ] Status updates from Pending to Completed
- [ ] Payment date is recorded
- [ ] Transaction ID is saved
- [ ] Status changes are logged
- [ ] Failed payments set status to Failed
- [ ] Refunded orders set status to Refunded

## API Security ✓
- [ ] Authentication is required
- [ ] Users can only access own orders
- [ ] Invoice access is restricted to owner
- [ ] Webhooks validate Stripe signature
- [ ] Error messages don't leak sensitive info

## Error Handling ✓
- [ ] Graceful handling of email failures
- [ ] Invoice generation errors are logged
- [ ] Missing order returns 404
- [ ] Unauthorized access returns 401
- [ ] Forbidden access returns 403
- [ ] Payment failures don't send confirmations

## Integration ✓
- [ ] Stripe webhooks trigger emails
- [ ] Payment success updates order
- [ ] Multiple payment methods supported
- [ ] Email service fallback (SMTP/SendGrid)
- [ ] Logging is comprehensive
- [ ] All services are registered in DI

###
